Tue Oct 27 18:36:54 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 0.9.97:
  * Security: centralize rationale-label credential redaction
    at a single pre-cache choke point and cover more leak
    shapes (URL userinfo, PEM bodies, glued tokens, Slack
    refresh tokens, short JWTs); benign strings left alone
  * Security: floor anyio at >= 4.14.2 in the mcp extra, above
    CVE-2026-63374 (IDNA hostname-validation bypass); anyio is
    transitive-only and the lockfile already resolves 4.15.1,
    so no spec dependency changes
  * Markdown: CommonMark ATX headings and fenced-code tracking,
    so headings inside fences no longer leak as structure
  * YAML: read the composed node tree, restoring written key
    spelling and source lines; 1.1 bare keys (on/off/yes/no)
    no longer folded to booleans
  * Extractors: aliased Terraform providers get their own nodes;
    Razor @implements and Blade wire:click bindings extracted;
    COBOL, Pascal, VBNET, Fortran, OCaml and Verilog scoping
    fixes; nested JS functions no longer leak into the
    file-wide name map
  * CLI, build and index robustness: bare query/explain --help
    prints usage; relation-less edges dropped; linked git
    worktrees pruned from scans; bad pnpm globs warned, not
    fatal; wikilink slugs and case-only renames fixed

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Oct 26 19:28:35 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 0.9.96:
  * Security: raise the Pillow floor to >= 13.0.0 on Python 3.11+
    (staying at >= 12.3.0 on 3.10, which Pillow 13 no longer
    supports) and pypdf to >= 6.19.0; refresh the lockfile to
    patched transitive dependencies, clearing most open
    Dependabot advisories (no CVE IDs named upstream)
  * Fix failed LLM chunks no longer reported as model omissions;
    Markdown papers included in watch quick-scan rebuilds;
    unfinished CheckRun statuses count as pending CI
  * Fix Obsidian export lists all parallel relations; DeepSeek
    backend sends max_tokens; Ollama window sized for non-Latin
    prompts; extract records token usage to cost.json
  * Fix Python member-call binding, Rust use scoping, Zig
    method/free-function calls, Dart extensions, TypeScript
    chained decorators, C# obj/bin pruning, VB.NET stubs
  * Perf: update with no input change skips the pipeline; watch
    rebuilds bounded by GRAPHIFY_REBUILD_TIMEOUT
  * Many more fixes and improvements; see upstream's release
    notes for the full list
- No spec dependency changes: the raised Pillow/pypdf floors are
  in upstream's optional extras, which this package does not ship

