Sun Oct 25 20:37:16 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 0.9.95:
  * 0.9.93: Kotlin typealias, C# delegate, Swift macro, Dart
    typedef and sibling-module Rust use resolve to declarations;
    credential redaction on rationale labels; versioned-shebang
    scripts classified
  * 0.9.94: URL validation rejects hostless/credential-bearing
    URLs, Maven POM contributes own dependencies only, T-SQL
    support and cross-file table-stub folding in SQL pass
  * 0.9.95: structural YAML extraction (new PyYAML dependency),
    per-language type-alias nodes, per-overload C# methods,
    symlink-proof skill-install writes, SSRF multicast block
  * AST cache schema bumped, so the first build after upgrading
    re-extracts
- Require python-PyYAML >= 6.0 (new upstream core dependency)
  and raise the setuptools floor to >= 83

