Sun Oct 18 17:23:55 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 0.9.92:
  * Call-resolution and id-collision fixes across JS/TS, Python,
    Go, Rust and Solidity extractors, including pytest fixture
    typing and Solidity inheritance via C3 linearization
  * MCP graph round-trip preserves parallel edges; node dedup
    and model-drifted confidence folding fixes
  * Skill fixes: code-only update path, Pi agent dispatch, and
    pushing to the exact Neo4j/FalkorDB URI supplied
  * Opt-in LLM backend selection via GRAPHIFY_BACKEND; dm extra
    capped to tree-sitter-dm below 0.26
  * AST cache schema bumped, so the first build after upgrading
    re-extracts
  * %check: skip three Julia extractor tests written for the
    tree-sitter-julia 0.23.1 node shapes; the 0.25.0 grammar
    restyles qualified imports and @enum forms

